  "summary": "An `ftp://` transfer configured with `CURLUSESSL_NONE` can reuse a pooled FTP",
  "details": "An `ftp://` transfer configured with `CURLUSESSL_NONE` can reuse a pooled FTP\ncontrol connection that a previous easy handle upgraded with `STARTTLS` and\nauthenticated using a client certificate. The second handle performs neither a\nnew TLS handshake nor a new FTP login, so the server continues to authorize it\nunder the first handle's certificate identity.",
  "severity": [
